          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Krutrim Pivots to AI Cloud Services, Reports 3x Revenue Growth and First Net Profit in FY26",
            "articleSection": "Discovery & Research",
            "abstract": "Krutrim, India's first AI unicorn, has announced a strategic pivot to become a focused domestic AI Cloud Services provider, reporting its first annual net profit in FY26 alongside threefold revenue growth. The company's platform is built entirely in-house and now serves over 25 large enterprise customers across multiple sectors. This marks a significant shift from a broad AI model developer to a sustainable, infrastructure-led cloud business — a milestone for India's homegrown AI industry.",
            "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/artificial-intelligence/krutrim-announces-strategic-pivot-to-ai-cloud-services-reports-3x-revenue-growth-and-first-net-profit-in-fy26/articleshow/130815491.cms",
